Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Music plays. Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't even looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I safe in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you psychos?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Nami and Robin, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this finds you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I do so look forward to\Nseeing the two of you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that when the time comes,\Nwe'll be better friends than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that\Nwe've only barely begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage\Nand a little bit of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things that\Neven as the years go by?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Will not ever vanish from our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:02:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see what sort of\Nform we're meant to take?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind\Nto dry All the tears as
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you're breathing The\Nthings you must overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.64,0:02:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.06,0:02:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:03:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look to that wind to dry all the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're braving the\Nthings you must overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Found new meaning, somebody new.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you and Luffy to grow up\Nand be marines like your granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But hopes be damned, you both\Nturned out to be hoodlums.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Notorious, dangerous ones at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you heard about what\Nyour brother's been up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I don't expect us\Nto get along perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But challenging the\Nworld government head-on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:04:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and wrecking up Annie's\Nlobby is over the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I told the\Nlittle punk about his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course the news took him by\Nsurprise can't blame the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fathers to hell with\Nthem and to help with
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you if you ever thought\Nwe could be Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've both got the blood of\Ncriminals flowing through our veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And that was the only gift\Nthose bastards ever gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the name Portgas from my\Nmother because I owe her so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't owe my father a damned thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even remember the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He can keep his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But the man tried. He wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:04:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worth too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To die in a place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Run wild! With us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Our flag will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will call you my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard is my only father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Momonga, I've\Nspotted a pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who it belongs to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the flag does look familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you don't recognize them,\Nthen they can't be anyone important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't be bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not right now, at least. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That sea king is huge. What if it attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd eat the whole ship\Nin one bite and that'd
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,be the end of us just
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,stay over there it's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,gone you know we came\Nall this way but now we
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,what what are we supposed to do what can\Nwe do come on alvida you have a plan right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the geniuses that spent\Nall our money on an Eternal pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like I'm the one\Nwho dragged you out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.18,0:06:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, we can't just\Nleave Buggy and Impel down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As his crew, we gotta go\Nsave him. Poor Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to enter the Calm Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the same as sailing\Ninto a nest of sea kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this ship is ready for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,there is one other way\Nfor us to get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's reserved for the Navy vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice won't\Nbe open for people like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought breaking him\Nout was the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we find out we can't\Neven get to the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He and his buddy Ace are gonna be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta help somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This would never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't kid yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't break in or out of the greatest\Nprison in the whole world. Better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For us to quit while we're still ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Back the clown had a good run but I'm\Nafraid his luck as a pirate has run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a man among men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way Captain Buggy can\Ngo out is in a blaze of glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our captain's not going anywhere,\Nespecially not the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Until he finds Captain John's\NTreasure Island, that's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And until that date comes,\Nwe're sticking with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:08:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take the big top and\Nget the hell out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can use a life raft or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you this is\NCaptain buggy ship not yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't see buggy anywhere. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to march\Nto Death's doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for this ship, I\Nwon't let you waste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Those conditions aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,if you want to rescue Buggy on\Nyour own, then I won't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be frank, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to last\Nfive minutes in those waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything,\Nbut this is farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream will live on,\Nin our hearts at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a peaceful execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.72,0:08:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,See you in the next slam, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel your grief, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no shame in sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Momonga, Marine Code G100660.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be sailing on the current\Nshortly, so prepare to open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy ship Luffy and Hancock are on is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,approaching the tub\Ncurrent used exclusively
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,by the Navy to travel between three of\Nthe world government's central facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, new guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to eat until you pay\Nyour respects to the cell leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Them's the rules around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you want me to do a little curtsy\Nevery time I take a bite out of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to give your\Nfood to the boss so
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to pound\Nyour sorry brains in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, you get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to get men down to shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a little disagreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even on death row.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Four and a half days\Nhave passed since Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and Hancock left the\Nmaiden island of Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry sir it's just\Nthat we're a bit late
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,sir the headwinds delayed\Nus but we contacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The prison we are late\Ndamn call Hancock and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,quickly sir uh lady Hancock\Nma 'am we've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy they got more ships\Nhere than they did for the buster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Call you've seen a buster. Call it's\Namazing you survived. I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it said that they're quite terrifying\NAce is Here you're sure yes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,although i imagine he's deep\Nunderwater hurry step inside my cloak
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Inside Town, Bicep of Momonga!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah, she's so hearty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, she sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the best in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Beauty is power, she's the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand votes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's like ten thousand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Train to the heart, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,These men are an affront\Nto my poor ears, Momonga.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,May I please turn them to stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I would rather you not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare say you've embarrassed the\NMarines enough for one lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now about that condition of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Before aiding in his execution, you\Nwanted to meet Portgas D .A .s, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me warn you once more\Nthat, warlord or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:12:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,as a pirate, you're not welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, before you enter,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They will perform a full\Nbody search. They will also
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,require you to wear sea\Nprism stone handcuffs inside
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They have to ensure that\Nyou don't launch any ill
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-fated attempts at rescuing\NAce or any other prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, they're doing a body check.\NWe'll figure something out, don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, go
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What buggy the clown you said\Nhe's missing and what's his power?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but vice-admiral Momonga and Empress\NHancock of the seven warlords have arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? I'll greet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She's great. Wait, I mean\Nsomebody open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful in air!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you, Hancock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a nice visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, imbeciles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's so sexy when she's angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, let me out! I'm dying\Nin here. Nobody deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,this it certainly lives\Nup to its reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite hellish indeed we've made it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,this far but i fear the\Nworst is ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my prison,\NImpel Down. Oops, jump the.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,gun there it's not well\Nexactly mine just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Vice Admiral here.\NAnnual well for now at
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,least it's a pleasure to\Nmeet you vice admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.68,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise we've been\Nexpecting you ah and this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,must be the pirate\Nempress my pirate empress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Pass jump the\Ngun again that's a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,ambitious i suppose the\Ndumbass warden is Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not what i meant the\Nperfectly competent warden
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,magellan is waiting in\Nhis office on level four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he would like to meet with\Nyou our vice manager of the jail here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,miss domino will be more than happy\Nto guide you there it seems you're
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.62,0:15:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,in a rush empress so allow me to\Nget this unpleasantness out of the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,way if you follow me we'll conduct\Nour body search and begin the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are a new prisoner\Nwe would have you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.58,0:15:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,enter the cell over\Nthere strip off all your
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,clothes and push you into\Nan iron pot filled with
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,boiling water. We call\Nit hell's hot tub. It's a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,baptism and sanitation\Nsolution all in one very
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,economical i think we\Nhave quite a number of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,celebrity prisoners by\Nthe way as you know fire
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,fist ace showed up recently\Nbut that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe of the Seven\NWardlords is a new addition,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and the former Wardlord Crocodile has\Nmade his residence here for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For the record,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,both are model prisoners that didn't\Nbat an eye at their little baptism.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, we search our\Nvisitors in a private room, after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,before we start could you please\Ntake off your cloak it would be far
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,too easy for you to hide something\Ninside there so i'm afraid you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,have to leave it behind don't\Nmistake our thoroughness for mistrust
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we simply have a reputation we would\Nlike to uphold and as you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,on the wall here we have surveillance\Ntransponder snails all over
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the prison their video footage is\Nmonitored in one of several security
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,rooms. Oh, and don't forget these
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,keep in mind that they're sea prism
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,stone you call me a visitor here not\Na prisoner then you put me in those
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Be gentle. I'm delicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it's safe now luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,wow that was close i was\Nstarting to think i'd just
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,have to crawl out from there\Nlike a cockroach and hope
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,for the best that power of\Nyours is really handy in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,a pinch huh even so i'm\Nafraid that this is as far as
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll be able to accompany\Nyou they're quite insistent
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,on placing me in those c\Nprism stone handcuffs and once
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,they take my cloak you'll\Nhave nowhere to hide i just
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,wish i wish i could do more\Nto help you but oh don't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,talk like that you got me\Nin this place didn't you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:18:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,that's more than i could\Nhave done alone even though
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,there's guards everywhere\Nwe made it all this way no
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem I can handle. The rest
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,luffy breaking your brother
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,out will be challenging\Nenough but if you get captured
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,as well who knows what\Nhorrors you might face one
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,wrong step and you may\Nnever see the light of day
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,again i know you want to save\Nace but this is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take care of yourself, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.10,0:18:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget what you've done,\Nnot for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He just called me by my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My real, actual name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.59,0:18:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever works for you, Hammock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get snap control over here, Hammock?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hammock, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:18:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My life is finally complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can die happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can turn that lady back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be fine up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Say my name again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is taking too long?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This situation is unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably just being thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's so naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your mind out of the gutter, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice-Wordant Hannibal,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we're not getting any visuals from the\Nsurveillance down in the examination room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something going on\Nin there we don't know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.74,0:19:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Domino, something wrong in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We have completed the body search sir
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Scratch that last report\Neverything is fine here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I didn't cause a problem sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the exam take too long?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine on our end, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I See that your guests are treated\Nas poorly as your prisoners here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely an empress\Ndeserves better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a pity but in Impel Down we can't\Nafford to make exceptions to the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why I can't shake\Nthis strange feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, if you'll let\Nme in front, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or just go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we visit Ace,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll take this elevator to what\Nwe call the burning heat floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where we'll stop by the\NWarden Magellan's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.66,0:20:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair warning, as the name\Nimplies, it's quite hot there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy be bold but be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye Hancock!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He really does love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Empress Hancock. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.42,0:21:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need mouth to mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You were fine just a\Nmoment ago. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, not sure where to\Ntake things from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hancock said Ace is probably underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like that elevator\Nmight head down a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.46,0:21:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, the fever card\Nmight come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they grabbed dinner, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it to the fridge and we'll be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The clown prisoner from level\None community cell number
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,four in the hallway in front\Nof solitary cell number 22?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid snail, this is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You blew it, buggy old don't come crying\Nto us when they're torturing you to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.66,0:22:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.98,0:22:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he'll wish he was dead for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here come the Bligotti.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.80,0:22:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Make him suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The fever guard keeps leading\Nme down, but now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.44,0:22:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm out of stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.54,0:23:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.68,0:23:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking for prisoner 8200. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The stupid clown?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.34,0:23:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knew he had Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.34,0:23:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You got the handcuffs?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.76,0:23:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.76,0:23:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Split up and flank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool. I made it. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.26,0:23:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So all of these are prison cells?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.78,0:23:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.58,0:23:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Buddy, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.02,0:23:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.93,0:23:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what it looks like, but how\Nthe heck did you get out of your cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.20,0:23:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.30,0:23:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I came in from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.22,0:23:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, bye. Hey, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.88,0:23:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.22,0:24:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, it's so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look like a jailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So who are you and why\Nthe hell are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.88,0:24:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not behind bars, so maybe it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.38,0:24:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have some really bad attitudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.36,0:24:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.27,0:24:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Any of you know where I can find Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.96,0:24:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.78,0:24:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.82,0:24:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean, him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.72,0:24:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy on death row?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.83,0:24:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to bust him out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.72,0:24:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't get a lot of info down here,\Nbut I heard they just brought him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.18,0:24:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's true and he is here,\Nthen he's got to be on level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.22,0:24:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No way you're getting down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.10,0:24:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're screwed, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.46,0:24:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the floor where\Nthey hold all the prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,with the bounty of a\Nhundred million or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Level five, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.60,0:24:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.24,0:24:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,why you here you think you could run to\Nthe jailer's room and pick us up some keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.98,0:24:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.89,0:24:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be no trouble, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.14,0:24:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This has got to be destiny, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.94,0:24:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what else would\Nbring us together like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.22,0:24:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you were born\Nto set us free, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.88,0:25:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.78,0:25:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the body!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like him! Run! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.04,0:25:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.78,0:25:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I take him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.26,0:25:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.48,0:25:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right side!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.42,0:25:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And left side!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.42,0:25:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How you like that, suckers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.38,0:25:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can cut me all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.84,0:25:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the chop-chop fruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.68,0:25:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.20,0:25:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.62,0:25:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.50,0:25:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for reminding me why I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.12,0:25:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I see prison hasn't made\Nyou any less annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.82,0:25:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, guess that King of the\NPirates thing ain't working out too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.08,0:25:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.32,0:26:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Only dumb people like you get\Ncaught and thrown in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.82,0:26:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.73,0:26:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You threw yourself in jail and\Nyou're calling me the dumb one?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.42,0:26:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have known I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.48,0:26:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the real reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're broken, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.68,0:26:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not into you, weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.56,0:26:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and get\Nthe hell out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.34,0:26:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I told Hancock I'd take\Ncare of myself and you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.98,0:26:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,got all these stupid axe\Nmonkeys chasing after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.98,0:26:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.36,0:26:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all about you, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.64,0:26:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.80,0:26:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I called it Buggy's Peaceful Escape Plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.22,0:26:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this look peaceful to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.10,0:26:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.20,0:26:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're surrounding us, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.20,0:26:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, should we just beat those things up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.56,0:26:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say you\Nhaven't been tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.12,0:26:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how my delicate body has suffered\Nfrom the blows of these monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't they think I'm\Nrunning away in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.54,0:27:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I wasn't\Nplanning to lose. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.48,0:27:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly you've thought this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.00,0:27:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a mission here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My cover's already been blown, so\NI gotta get this done in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.78,0:27:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, that's the number one reason\Nwhy I hate you and that redhead so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.30,0:27:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you are always so optimistic\Nin the worst way possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.66,0:27:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.78,0:27:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go along with your crazy plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.86,0:27:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.10,0:27:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.12,0:27:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for my specialty!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.76,0:27:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Causing chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.14,0:27:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Works for me!
